// spec/computerUse/index.md, "Story: Control an authorized computer session"; spec/computerUse/batching.md, "Story: Execute a bounded sequence of desktop actions in a single LLM turn"; spec/computerUse/approvals.md, "Story: Gate computer-use commands by approval mode and operator decisions"; spec/computerUse/index.md, "A session grants only the operations its bound target can carry out, and each command is its own operation"
